    <h1>Arcadia Sanitizer</h1>
    <p>The Arcadia Sanitizer is a native C tool and library for checking and
    normalizing source-file whitespace on Windows and Linux. It uses Arcadia's
    own FileSystem, FilePath, DirectoryIterator, FileHandle, and byte-buffer APIs.</p>
